{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-01-30T00:37:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T15:19:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.3 stable, 4.4 beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you search a file by its name in FileSystem in Split Mode, then doubleclick the first one, it focuses on the wrong file (the last one in the list) if the files have the same name. Although it opens the one you clicked on. Which is confusing \n\nFile structure:\n\nfolder1 / new_script.gd\nfolder2 / new_script.gd\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b366fede-0488-4ec8-83ca-0820de814c89\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate 2 folders\nCreate 1 file in each of them with the same name\nSearch the file name in FileSystem in Split Mode\nClick on the first one\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[file_focus_bug_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18595891/file_focus_bug_MRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102167/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}